Add WeightContainer::push_back(value, name) so HepMC 2 can store named weights.

The added code is MadGraph5_aMC@NLO's HepMC 2 hack (HEPMC2HACK), which its
installer applies to HepMC 2 so that Pythia 8 writes every event weight as a
named weight into one .hepmc file. Applied to HepMC 2.06.11 on 2026-11-01 for
https://github.com/startown-ai/madgraph.

